:HELP NAME=CHGDEVMLB.Change Device Desc (Media Lib) (CHGDEVMLB)
:P.Use the Change Device Desc (Media Lib) (CHGDEVMLB) command to change
a media library device description; what is not given stays as it is.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/DEVD'.Device description (DEVD)
:P.The device description.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/RSRCNAME'.Resource name (RSRCNAME)
:P.The hardware resource name, as WRKHDWRSC shows it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*VRT:EPK.
:PD.Virtual.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/ONLINE'.Online at IPL (ONLINE)
:P.Whether the device or line is varied on when the system starts (IPL).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.It is varied on at IPL.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.It stays varied off until someone varies it on.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/UNLOADWAIT'.Unload wait time (UNLOADWAIT)
:P.The unload wait time for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSGEN:EPK.
:PD.The value the system generates.
:PT.:PK.*NOMAX:EPK.
:PD.No limit.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 600.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/MAXDEVTIME'.Maximum device wait time (MAXDEVTIME)
:P.The maximum device wait time for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSGEN:EPK.
:PD.The value the system generates.
:PT.:PK.*NOMAX:EPK.
:PD.No limit.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 600.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/GENCTGID'.Generate cartridge ids (GENCTGID)
:P.The generate cartridge ids for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSGEN:EPK.
:PD.The value the system generates.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *VOLID.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/MSGQ'.Message queue (MSGQ)
:P.The message queue that receives the messages the command or the
object sends.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSOPR:EPK.
:PD.QSYSOPR, the system operator's message queue.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVMLB/TEXT'.Text 'description' (TEXT)
:P.A short description of the object, up to 50 characters, shown by the
work-with and display commands next to its name.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The text does not change.
:PT.:PK.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.No text.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 50 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
