:HELP NAME=CHGDEVPRT.Change Device Desc (Printer) (CHGDEVPRT)
:P.Use the Change Device Desc (Printer) (CHGDEVPRT) command to change a
printer device description; what is not given stays as it is.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/DEVD'.Device description (DEVD)
:P.The device description.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/PORT'.Port number (PORT)
:P.The TCP or UDP port number.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 65535.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/ONLINE'.Online at IPL (ONLINE)
:P.Whether the device or line is varied on when the system starts (IPL).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.It is varied on at IPL.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.It stays varied off until someone varies it on.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/PRTQLTY'.Print quality (PRTQLTY)
:P.The print quality&colon. draft, normal text or near-letter quality.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*STD:EPK.
:PD.Standard.
:PT.:PK.*DRAFT:EPK.
:PD.Draft quality.
:PT.:PK.*NLQ:EPK.
:PD.Near letter quality.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/FONT'.Font (FONT)
:P.The font the printer uses.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Identifier
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Point size
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 4 digits, 1 of them after the decimal point.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/FORMFEED'.Form feed (FORMFEED)
:P.How paper is fed to the printer&colon. continuous forms, cut sheets
fed by hand, or an automatic sheet feeder.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CONT:EPK.
:PD.Continuous forms.
:PT.:PK.*CUT:EPK.
:PD.Single cut sheets fed by hand.
:PT.:PK.*AUTOCUT:EPK.
:PD.Single cut sheets from a sheet feeder.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *TYPE, *CONT2.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/SEPDRAWER'.Separator drawer (SEPDRAWER)
:P.The separator drawer for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*FILE:EPK.
:PD.The value of the file.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 255.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/SEPPGM'.Separator program (SEPPGM)
:P.The separator program for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
