:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *MFRTYPMDL, *MONARCH, *NUMBER9, *NUMBER10, *B5,
*C5, *DL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/MAXPNDRQS'.Maximum pending requests (MAXPNDRQS)
:P.The maximum pending requests for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 31.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/PRTRQSTMR'.Print request timer (PRTRQSTMR)
:P.The print request timer for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NOMAX:EPK.
:PD.No limit.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 3600.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/CHRID'.Character identifier (CHRID)
:P.The graphic character set and code page of the data.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Graphic character set
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 32767.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Code page
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 32767.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVPRT/RMTLOCNAME'.Remote location (RMTLOCNAME)
